tion query: 'J Cell Biol||175|305||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17060498</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>James</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Beauchamp</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Manchanda</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kazlauskas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramesh</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A NHERF binding site links the beta PDGFR to the cytoskeleton and regulates cell spreading and migration</article-title><source>J Cell Sci</source><year>2004</year><volume>117</volume><fpage>2951</fpage><lpage>2961</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Cell Sci||117|2951||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15161943</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>James</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Manchanda</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonzalez-Agosti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Hartwig</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramesh</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The neurofibromatosis 2 protein product merlin selectively binds F-actin but not G-actin, and stabilizes the filaments through a lateral association</article-title><source>Biochem J</source><year>2001</year><volume>356</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>386</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biochem J||356|377||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11368764</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jekely</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Small GTPases and the evolution of the eukaryotic cell<